Package: micsPlusTableR
Title: MICS Plus Excel Tabulation and Review Application
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("MICS Plus", "Tabulation Team", email = "micsplustabler@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs interactive and scriptable workflows for preparing,
    tabulating, checking, reviewing, and exporting MICS Plus tables from an
    Excel tabulation plan, survey data files, and a survey-specific preparation
    script.
